The robot's 3D model files (.stl meshes under
src/mjlab_microduck/robot/*/assets/) are licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 —
NON-COMMERCIAL. Read the upstream LICENSE and LICENSE-MODELS.md before
reproducing, printing or modifying the robot's geometry.
